{# ===========================================================================
   Dietary and preparation glyphs for the menu concepts.

   NOT brand sprite icons. The Tajima sprite carries nothing for vegan,
   vegetarian or raw, so these three are lifted from the reference mockups,
   which is where they were drawn.

   SPICY IS NOT HERE ANY MORE, 2026-09-16. It was a hand-drawn #m-spicy, and
   it was an unclosed outline: three open paths with the pepper's left flank,
   from (3.8,17.7) back up to the stem, never drawn. It rendered as a hook
   with a detached spur rather than a chili.

   The approved reference does not use a hand-drawn mark for it. It uses the
   BRAND chili, which it calls #i-chili-pepper and which is byte identical to
   src/_includes/icons/chili.svg. So spicy reads the sprite now, and
   menuConcepts.json's legend names the symbol each mark draws.

   Emitted once per page as <symbol>, used by <use>, same pattern as
   icon-sprite.njk.
   =========================================================================== #}
<svg class="icon-sprite" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  <symbol id="m-vegan" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
    <path fill="currentColor" d="M20 4c0 8.5-4.6 13-11.2 13H5.2C5.2 9.5 10.4 4.6 20 4Z"/>
    <path d="M4 21c1.6-4.4 4.4-7.6 8.4-9.7"/>
  </symbol>
  <symbol id="m-vegetarian" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
    <path d="M20 4c0 8.5-4.6 13-11.2 13H5.2C5.2 9.5 10.4 4.6 20 4Z"/>
    <path d="M4 21c1.6-4.4 4.4-7.6 8.4-9.7"/>
  </symbol>
  <symbol id="m-raw" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
    <path d="M21.4 12c-2.7 3.2-5.7 4.8-9 4.8S6.1 15.2 3.4 12c2.7-3.2 5.7-4.8 9-4.8s6.3 1.6 9 4.8Z"/>
    <path d="M3.4 12 .9 9.2v5.6L3.4 12Z"/>
    <circle cx="16.8" cy="10.9" r=".95" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
  </symbol>
</svg>
